    "detailed_description": "<h1>DISCORD SERVER</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841800/extras/f883188f0c19a6f7d81ebbae1a8b3b33.avif?t=1650118834\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841800/extras/2cc9311fa1e7013e2ca888c59869ea1a.poster.avif?t=1650118834\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841800/extras/2cc9311fa1e7013e2ca888c59869ea1a.webm?t=1650118834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841800/extras/2cc9311fa1e7013e2ca888c59869ea1a.mp4?t=1650118834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Defend your kingdom</h2>Dicey Towers is a strategy tower defense game that requires you to manage your defenses so that you can defeat countless waves of enemies. Towers can be managed, upgraded, and combined to create synergies and builds that best suit any play style.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Towers</h2>15 towers with more planned!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841800/extras/fc9f26ce51deb6e466bfebdf5a8ecdb4.poster.avif?t=1650118834\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841800/extras/fc9f26ce51deb6e466bfebdf5a8ecdb4.apng?t=1650118834\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enemies</h2>11 unique enemies, including 3 difficult bosses<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841800/extras/8056872267c3dcc19f3da5ae19b2c1c5.poster.avif?t=1650118834\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841800/extras/8056872267c3dcc19f3da5ae19b2c1c5.webm?t=1650118834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Please give us feedback while we continue to develop this game!",
